          "text": "Video eye examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Mild bilateral lid-margin erythema, especially of the upper lids. Sclerae appear mildly injected, although the image is intermittently pixelated. No obvious lid swelling or chalazion; crusting not visible at the time of examination. Extraocular movements grossly full. Examination limited by video resolution."
      }
    },
